WMI GUID DC2A8805-3A8C-41BA-A6F7-092E0089CD3B
The Other Mode WMI interface uses the firmware_attributes class to expose various WMI attributes provided by the interface in the sysfs. This enables CPU and GPU power limit tuning as well as various other attributes for devices that fall under the "Gaming Series" of Lenovo devices.
/sys/class/firmware-attributes/lenovo-wmi-other/attributes//
Additionally, this driver also exports attributes to HWMON.
